# Instantly warmup poller - pulls health_score + days_warming per mailbox.
# Runs every 4 hours so the CRM wmh% column reflects fresh-ish data without
# burning Instantly API quota. Health scores typically move on day boundaries
# (Instantly aggregates by date) so sub-hourly polling buys nothing.
0 */4 * * * /usr/local/bin/python /app/warmup-poller/process_warmup_poller.py
